transfer to rival Oklahoma, sources told ESPN.","published":"2026-01-06T19:52:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47529528/sources-oklahoma-lands-texas-transfer-parker-livingstone","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC calls out refs for missing Oklahoma's 'hideout tactic'","description":"The SEC vowed \"appropriate accountability\" after it said officials failed to identify a \"hideout tactic\" on Oklahoma's second-quarter touchdown against Auburn.","published":"2025-09-21T16:17:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/46330363/sec-calls-refs-missing-oklahoma-hideout-tactic","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-27T12:39:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Inside the Pac-12's flex schedule decision to boost Boise State","description":"A look at how the Pac-12 ironed out its first flex week football schedule.","published":"2026-11-27T12:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592934/pac-12-flex-schedule-boise-state-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What rivalries have the biggest stakes? Connelly looks at the end of the season","description":"Among 20 big games, some classic rivalries have fallen down the pecking order.","published":"2026-11-27T12:25:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595179/connelly-rivalry-week-stakes-preview","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Best friends Pat Surtain II, Jaylen Waddle ecstatic about reuniting with Broncos","description":"Surtain and Waddle bonded immediately at Alabama six years ago and have embraced the chance to play together again in Denver on a team with Super Bowl hopes.","published":"2026-11-27T11:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50595313/pat-surtain-ii-jaylen-waddle-broncos-alabama-best-friends","type":"Story","byline":"Jeff Legwold","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top DE D.J. Jacobs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5080703/isaiah-sategna-iii","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isaiah_Sategna_III"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Isaiah Sategna III","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isaiah_Sategna_III","description":"American football player (born 2003)","touched":"2026-11-26T23:15:22Z","intro":"Isaiah Sategna III (born July 11, 2003) is an American college football wide receiver for the Oklahoma Sooners. He previously played for the Arkansas Razorbacks.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Sategna III attended Fayetteville High School in Fayetteville, Arkansas. As a senior, he had 100 receptions for a nation-leading 1,908 yards and 17 touchdowns. For his career, he had 172 receptions for 3,261 receiving yards and 25 touchdowns. Sategna III originally committed to Texas A&M University and the University of Oregon before ultimately choosing the University of Arkansas."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first year at Arkansas in 2022, he redshirted after appearing in four games and recording two receptions for 12 yards. In 2023, he appeared in 12 games with one start and had 15 receptions for 129 yards with two touchdowns and 23 kick returns for 500 yards and 15 punt returns for 180 yards and one touchdown. In 2024, he started 10 of 12 games, finishing with 37 receptions for 491 yards with a touchdown. After the season, Sategna transferred to the University of Oklahoma. For the 2025 season, Sategna led OU in receptions (67), receiving yards (965), and receiving touchdowns (8) and was named 1st team All-SEC. The Sooners finished the season 10-3 after losing to Alabama in the first round of the playoffs. Sategna will return to Oklahoma for his senior season in 2026."}]}}